  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen you are changing the Nameplate Display Setting (Show Nameplates, Show Icons Only, Hide Nameplates) in the Main Menu (QM works fine), the Quick Menu Info will be disabled. The buttons for it in the Quick and Main Menu will still show it as enabled though, but when opening your Quick Menu you will notice that the QM Info is not displayed.\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n1. Go to Main Menu > Settings > User Interface\n2. Change your Nameplate Display Option (even clicking on the one you are already using works)\n3. Close the Main Menu and open your Quick Menu\nIf you are now looking at the Nameplates of people in your World, you will notice that the Quick Menu Info is not displayed.\nTurning the Quick Menu Info off and back on fixes this, as well as just selecting the Nameplate Display Setting in the Quick Menu again.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/wqleqq",
